@startuml
title SC-01 - MobilityHub Lifecycle

[*] --> Active : Hub registered and initialized

state Active
state Peak_Load
state Maintenance
state Offline

Active --> Peak_Load : Utilization exceeds threshold
Peak_Load --> Active : Utilization returns to normal

Active --> Maintenance : Maintenance required
Peak_Load --> Maintenance : Maintenance required

Maintenance --> Active : Maintenance completed\nand Hub verified operational

Active --> Offline : Hub becomes unavailable
Peak_Load --> Offline : Hub becomes unavailable
Maintenance --> Offline : Hub loses connectivity

Offline --> Active : Connectivity restored\nand Hub verified operational

@enduml